<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Kazi Konnect - Indonesia Strategy</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: #F3F4F6;
            color: #1F2937;
        }
        .chart-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
            height: 300px;
            max-height: 400px;
        }
        @media (min-width: 640px) {
            .chart-container {
                height: 350px;
            }
        }
        @media (min-width: 1024px) {
            .chart-container {
                height: 400px;
            }
        }
        .brand-teal {
            color: #00A0B0;
        }
        .brand-bg-teal {
            background-color: #00A0B0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto p-4 md:p-8">

        <header class="text-center mb-10">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold brand-teal mb-2">Kazi Konnect: Indonesia</h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-600">Marketing & Growth Budget</p>
        </header>

        <section class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 md:p-8 mb-8">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">Our Core Message</h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6">
                Kazi Konnect gives Indonesian schools a simple, powerful platform to teach and assess the critical soft skills students need for the future. We make it easy for teachers to integrate skills like critical thinking and collaboration into their existing curriculum, providing students with a digital portfolio that proves their abilities to universities and employers.
            </p>
            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6 text-center">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1">Indonesia's EdTech Market Opportunity</h3>
                <p class="text-5xl font-bold brand-teal">$3.2 Billion</p>
                <p class="text-md text-gray-600 mt-1">(Projected to reach $8.8B by 2033)</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 md:p-8 mb-8">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">Our Go-to-Market Strategy</h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6">
                We will use a mix of digital and offline strategies to build relationships with school administrators, teachers, and key educational partners.
            </p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold brand-teal mb-2">LinkedIn</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-700">
                        We'll target school administrators and NGO partners with professional case studies, data on the 21st-century skills gap, and articles on educational leadership.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold brand-teal mb-2">Instagram</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-700">
                        We'll engage teachers and parents with short videos of student projects, testimonials, and "Skill of the Week" graphics to build a community.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold brand-teal mb-2">Offline: Teacher Workshops</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-700">
                        We will host hands-on training and onboarding workshops to empower teachers, demonstrate value, and build strong school relationships.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold brand-teal mb-2">Offline: NGO Partnerships</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-700">
                        We will partner with educational NGOs and attend government conferences to reach public school decision-makers and secure grant-based funding.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 md:p-8 mb-8">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">Our 12-Month Startup Budget</h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6">
                Our venture needs **$138,000 USD** for the first 12 months. This budget is designed for focused growth and efficient operations, breaking down to a lean **$11,500 USD in total monthly costs**.
            </p>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 text-center font-semibold">
                Total 12-Month Cost Breakdown (Total: $138,000)
            </p>
            <div class="chart-container">
                <canvas id="budgetChart"></canvas>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-4 text-center">
                This chart shows the total 12-month cost for each major category. Operations & Staff and Platform Development represent our primary investments, ensuring a high-quality product and strong support for our school partners.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 md:p-8 mb-8">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">Revenue Model & Breakeven</h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6">
                Our primary revenue stream from private schools is a simple, affordable annual subscription. Our breakeven point is based on our modest monthly costs.
            </p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6 text-center shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1">Pricing Model</h3>
                    <p class="text-5xl font-bold brand-teal">$50</p>
                    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">Per Student / Per Year</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6 text-center shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1">Monthly Breakeven Point</h3>
                    <p class="text-5xl font-bold brand-teal">2,757</p>
                    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">Subscribed Students</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mt-8 mb-6 text-center font-semibold">
                Balancing Costs and Revenue
            </p>
            <div class="chart-container">
                <canvas id="breakevenChart"></canvas>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-4 text-center">
                This chart shows our path to profitability. The dashed red line represents our fixed monthly costs of $11,500. The teal line shows how revenue grows as student subscriptions increase (at $4.17/month). The point where they intersect, at 2,757 students, is our breakeven point.
            </p>
        </section>
        
        <section class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 md:p-8 mb-8">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">Jakarta: A Key Target Market</h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6">
                The Jakarta market provides a strong starting point with a high concentration of target private and international schools, allowing us to build a dense network of users.
            </p>
            <div class="chart-container">
                <canvas id="marketChart"></canvas>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-4 text-center">
                This chart shows the number of target schools in Jakarta. Our initial sales efforts will focus on these 391 institutions to establish a strong foothold.
            </p>
        </section>

    </div>

    <script>
        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {

            const chartColors = ['#00A0B0', '#E84A5F', '#FFC425', '#8C82FC', '#545E75'];
            const tickColor = '#374151';

            const tooltipTitleCallback = (tooltipItems) => {
                const item = tooltipItems[0];
                let label = item.chart.data.labels[item.dataIndex];
                if (Array.isArray(label)) {
                    return label.join(' ');
                } else {
                    return label;
                }
            };

            const commonPlugins = {
                tooltip: {
                    callbacks: {
                        title: tooltipTitleCallback
                    },
                    backgroundColor: '#1F2937',
                    titleColor: '#FFFFFF',
                    bodyColor: '#FFFFFF',
                    borderColor: '#4B5563',
                    borderWidth: 1
                },
                legend: {
                    labels: {
                        color: tickColor,
                        font: {
                            size: 14
                        }
                    }
                }
            };

            const commonScales = {
                x: {
                    ticks: {
                        color: tickColor,
                        font: {
                            size: 12
                        }
                    },
                    grid: {
                        display: false
                    }
                },
                y: {
                    ticks: {
                        color: tickColor,
                        font: {
                            size: 12
                        }
                    },
                    grid: {
                        color: '#E5E7EB'
                    }
                }
            };

            const budgetCtx = document.getElementById('budgetChart').getContext('2d');
            new Chart(budgetCtx, {
                type: 'bar',
                data: {
                    labels: [
                        ['Platform', 'Development'],
                        ['Operations &', 'Staff'],
                        ['Marketing &', 'Sales'],
                        ['Training &', 'Implementation'],
                        'General Admin'
                    ],
                    datasets: [{
                        label: '12-Month Cost',
                        data: [36000, 48000, 24000, 18000, 12000],
                        backgroundColor: chartColors,
                        borderRadius: 4
                    }]
                },
                options: {
                    indexAxis: 'y',
                    responsive: true,
                    maintainAspectRatio: false,
                    plugins: {
                        ...commonPlugins,
                        legend: {
                            display: false
                        },
                        tooltip: {
                            ...commonPlugins.tooltip,
                            callbacks: {
                                ...commonPlugins.tooltip.callbacks,
                                label: function(context) {
                                    let label = context.dataset.label || '';
                                    if (label) {
                                        label += ': ';
                                    }
                                    if (context.parsed.x !== null) {
                                        label += new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US', { style: 'currency', currency: 'USD', maximumFractionDigits: 0 }).format(context.parsed.x);
                                    }
                                    return label;
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    scales: {
                        ...commonScales,
                        x: {
                            ...commonScales.x,
                            grid: {
                                color: '#E5E7EB'
                            },
                            ticks: {
                                ...commonScales.x.ticks,
                                callback: function(value) {
                                    return new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US', { style: 'currency', currency: 'USD', notation: 'compact' }).format(value);
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        y: {
                            ...commonScales.y,
                            grid: {
                                display: false
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            });

            const breakevenCtx = document.getElementById('breakevenChart').getContext('2d');
            new Chart(breakevenCtx, {
                type: 'line',
                data: {
                    labels: [
                        '0',
                        '1000',
                        '2000',
                        ['2,757', '(Breakeven)'],
                        '4000',
                        '5000'
                    ],
                    datasets: [{
                        label: 'Total Monthly Revenue',
                        data: [0, 4170, 8340, 11500, 16680, 20850],
                        borderColor: chartColors[0],
                        backgroundColor: 'rgba(0, 160, 176, 0.1)',
                        fill: true,
                        tension: 0.1,
                        pointRadius: [0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0],
                        pointBackgroundColor: chartColors[2],
                        pointBorderColor: chartColors[2],
                    },{
                        label: 'Total Monthly Costs',
                        data: [11500, 11500, 11500, 11500, 11500, 11500],
                        borderColor: chartColors[1],
                        borderDash: [5, 5],
                        fill: false,
                        pointRadius: [0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0],
                        pointBackgroundColor: chartColors[2],
                        pointBorderColor: chartColors[2],
                    }]
                },
                options: {
                    responsive: true,
                    maintainAspectRatio: false,
                    plugins: {
                        ...commonPlugins,
                        tooltip: {
                            ...commonPlugins.tooltip,
                            callbacks: {
                                ...commonPlugins.tooltip.callbacks,
                                label: function(context) {
                                    let label = context.dataset.label || '';
                                    if (label) {
                                        label += ': ';
                                    }
                                    if (context.parsed.y !== null) {
                                        label += new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US', { style: 'currency', currency: 'USD', maximumFractionDigits: 0 }).format(context.parsed.y);
                                    }
                                    return label;
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    scales: {
                        ...commonScales,
                        x: {
                            ...commonScales.x,
                            title: {
                                display: true,
                                text: 'Number of Students',
                                color: tickColor
                            }
                        },
                        y: {
                            ...commonScales.y,
                            title: {
                                display: true,
                                text: 'Monthly Amount (USD)',
                                color: tickColor
                            },
                            ticks: {
                                ...commonScales.y.ticks,
                                callback: function(value) {
                                    return new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US', { style: 'currency', currency: 'USD', maximumFractionDigits: 0 }).format(value);
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            });

            const marketCtx = document.getElementById('marketChart').getContext('2d');
            new Chart(marketCtx, {
                type: 'bar',
                data: {
                    labels: [
                        'Private Schools',
                        ['International', 'Schools']
                    ],
                    datasets: [{
                        label: 'Number of Schools',
                        data: [330, 61],
                        backgroundColor: [chartColors[0], chartColors[2]],
                        borderRadius: 4
                    }]
                },
                options: {
                    responsive: true,
                    maintainAspectRatio: false,
                    plugins: {
                        ...commonPlugins,
                        legend: {
                            display: false
                        }
                    },
                    scales: commonScales
                }
            });

        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>


